Dialogue: 2,0:01:59.81,0:02:05.48,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(977,981)\t(936,977,\1a&H00&)\t(4689,4731,\1a&HFF&)}Millet Dumplings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me. Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My next punch will end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhh! Ahhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.90,0:03:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did he get hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody hit him at all—it's a side effect\Nof that cannonball form of his now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the next 10 minutes or so, you can't\Nuse any hockey—that's how it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it works All that power comes at a cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it looks like a good trade-off to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.66,0:04:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those punches really\Ndid a number on Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our chance to finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little oafs are pushing\Nyour luck again, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't move, you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worn out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it was a lovely rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.50,0:04:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all good things must\Ncome to an end, as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy Mother's Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, hand over, saw hat, or get burnt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Counter-shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.28,0:05:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, killer, we gotta keep the\Npressure on him! Let's go! Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind that blows from the\Nheavens shall rend the land asunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our second natural\Ndisaster in one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:07:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you big lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got another thing coming if you\Nthink I'm gonna let you eat my captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is again, that strange Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sense it coming from his blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three-Sword Style: Black\NRope Great Dragon Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cut his scales!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good! Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little punk hurt Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pain is familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems my suspicions were correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you end up with Odin's blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think your dragon\Ntwister can stand up to mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to learn your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laura, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got another big one coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demolition Dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This evening has not gone as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our supplier getting\Nbeheaded was bad enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now the entire banquet\Nhas become a battlefield.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:31.05,0:11:35.59,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b505\fscx85\fscy85\fnA-OTF Shin Go Pr5 M-Strp\pos(997,710)\bord0\c&H1B1A18&\blur0.8\fad(558,0)\fsp1}Cipher Pol Aigis 0\NWorld's Most Powerful Intelligence Agency
Dialogue: 2,0:11:31.05,0:11:35.59,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b505\fscx85\fscy85\fnA-OTF Shin Go Pr5 M-Strp\pos(997,710)\blur0.8\bord2\shad0\1a&HFF&\fsp1\t(516,558,\1a&H00&)\c&HFEFCF9&\fad(558,0)\3c&HFEFCF9&\4c&HFEFCF9&}Cipher Pol Aigis 0\NWorld's Most Powerful Intelligence Agency
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.05,0:11:35.59,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b505\fscx85\fscy85\fnA-OTF Shin Go Pr5 M-Strp\pos(997,710)\blur4\bord7\shad0\1a&HFF&\fsp1\t(516,558,\1a&H00&)\c&H1B1A18&\fad(558,0)\3c&H1B1A18&\4c&HFEFCF9&}Cipher Pol Aigis 0\NWorld's Most Powerful Intelligence Agency
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems to be an act of vengeance in the\Nname of a ruler who died 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.84,0:11:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wano's history aside this\Nshouldn't come as a surprise
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the moment that doflamingo\Nfell from power a clash
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between kaido and the worst\Ngeneration became inevitable
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.64,0:11:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now we're dealing with\Nthe perfect storm. Only fate
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:11:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could bring the samurai and\Npirates together at a time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like this soon right before\Nour eyes the world will
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be turned on its head it's\Nunlikely but think of what
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would happen if both emperors\Nwere taken down at once
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be chaos impossible to predict
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we need not worry about that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The invaders are here and\Ntheir numbers are clear
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifty-four hundred or\Nsomething near number 5,400.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.88,0:12:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minus the four hundred dead, I fear
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did we fare, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beast pirates are surely winning the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,30,000 have entered the fray,\Nbut 3,000 are dead to our dismay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say, the samurai did a fine job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of their difference in numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.30,0:13:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they couldn't even reach Kaido\Nif they attacked head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deciding to launch a surprise assault\Nwas surely the correct choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was their only choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this battle won't end even\Nif they take Kaido's head!
