Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an Alto war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.02,0:13:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no refuge on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido's officers are absurdly powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they don't finish them off as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll butcher the\Nsamurai 100 men at a time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to the worst\Ngeneration to defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one else can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.48,0:13:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, this game of Go will\Nend with a board full of black.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too early to say\Nwhich side will prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:14:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your best to kill each\Nother, you filthy pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did he transform?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be his man—beast form!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.32,0:14:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned! In.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I gotta admit this is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took the words right\Nout of my mouth—you've?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've really thrown quite the party!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everyone!
