Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To break the deadlock, Master Queen\Nentrusted me with a secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.76,0:15:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something to leave the enemy\Nquaking in their boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.52,0:15:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And might I say, you're looking as\Nmajestic as ever, General Speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the weapon, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, it's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.24,0:15:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My skin shimmers like the sun. Flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As resilient as iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my muscles, they pulse with strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.22,0:15:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, that's starting\Nto look real good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need that dumpling now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fuck it over, damn you!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.46,0:15:40.79,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1482,710)\bord2.5\blur0.8\c&HEBEAEB&\3c&HEBEAEB&\fscx125\fscy125\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro H Strp\1a&HFF&\fad(228,0)\t(186,228,\1a&H00&)}Headliner Briscola\N{\bord2\fscx100\fscy100\fnRoboto\b1}Gorilla Smile Fruit\N{\bord2\fnVAG Rounded Std Light\b0}Beast Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:15:38.46,0:15:40.79,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1482,710)\bord0\blur0.8\c&H060608&\fscx125\fscy125\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro H Strp\fad(228,0)}Headliner Briscola\N{\fscx100\fscy100\fnRoboto\b1}Gorilla Smile Fruit\N{\fnVAG Rounded Std Light\b0}Beast Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like you've suffered\Nquite the loss, Briscola.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The point is, I gotta get my\Nrevenge on the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it takes this miracle dumpling of\Nyours to do that, then put it in my mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.84,0:16:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Far be it from me to stop you\Nonce you eat one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your whole world will change here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,General, hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feels like it might be working\Nor it might not be working.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.84,0:16:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a load of nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know this\Nability-enhancing dumpling is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a masterpiece made by none\Nother than master queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.14,0:16:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you're not saying it's a failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'd like to tell him in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.42,0:16:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly a surge of power is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coursing through my veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I gotta get me one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,General speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I have a doubling too, pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.62,0:17:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have enough for all gifters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.50,0:17:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.65,0:17:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.04,0:17:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as you finish eating,\Nget ready to join the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.86,0:17:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are giving their best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Risa-Lina, I wanna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna go to Onigashima with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't blame them\Nfor leaving me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it makes me sad, so please—he,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.34,0:17:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what that frown off your face, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,master
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.64,0:18:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.22,0:18:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to rest and recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't buy Kaido myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.52,0:18:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the only way I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be okay and I have\Nto be brave enough to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the future of my country too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.32,0:18:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A future without Kaido and Odoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's worth fighting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:19:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I can't be hungry\Nfor the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to eat real food whenever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.20,0:19:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have a meal first then hide\Nand wait for our chance to strike
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, my fellow\Ngifters, eat them all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's Difugo,\Nthe vice warden from Udon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.44,0:19:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.74,0:19:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pay you back for all\Nthe suffering you caused us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we call it water\Nunder the bridge for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:19:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,General Difugo, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleased to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but let's cut the\Nformalities. Eat this! Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now serve the master and serve her well!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.46,0:20:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.66,0:20:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.57,0:20:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, where that came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I just saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold down the robot and don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.40,0:21:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't win with you guys on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.24,0:21:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the idea, you big metal dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.02,0:21:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be tough, but there's no\Nway you can shake off all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all gifters with superhuman powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got you locked down, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're strong as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.14,0:21:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.81,0:21:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.73,0:21:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usa! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agotama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.01,0:21:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.70,0:21:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of in a pinch right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.50,0:21:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you guys help me out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got all these dudes\Npiled up on me, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.26,0:22:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.08,0:22:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.10,0:22:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, they got it worse than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They actually scratched that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.34,0:22:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm in double trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.52,0:22:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gifters, keep doing what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.68,0:22:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Block their escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do you see how outnumbered you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.84,0:22:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you win here,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd have to turn the tide all\Nacross the island to stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, I'm so screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.30,0:22:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came here to turn the tide, and\Nthat's exactly what I'm going to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.86,0:22:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.26,0:22:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go help Rondo's stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son-Hack-Breeeek!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.36,0:23:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it, bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.28,0:23:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.14,0:23:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tang, you nearly busted me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.57,0:23:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found my face again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.22,0:23:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ndoing, you idiots?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.52,0:23:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.48,0:23:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one, ulti!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Switch over to the enemy's side!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.20,0:23:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike the bastards down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.34,0:23:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.76,0:23:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do they have to gain\Nby siding with the samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.98,0:23:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're probably using some\Nstupid Devil Fruit power!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.12,0:23:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're begging for a headbutt,\Nand I've got plenty to go around!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.62,0:23:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't take a hint, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.18,0:23:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your lightning alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.32,0:24:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might put you into cardiac\Narrest, so good luck with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.34,0:24:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunder wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.46,0:24:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.34,0:24:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fix this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.36,0:24:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.74,0:24:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're getting double the\Nheadbutts next time, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.10,0:24:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling that wouldn't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.34,0:24:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I need more powerful\Nlightning to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.14,0:24:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're pretty tricky, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.78,0:24:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take those pirates down immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.28,0:24:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could get ugly if we let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.86,0:24:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, Sasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.92,0:24:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.40,0:24:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumpling star!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I just swallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.76,0:24:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.74,0:24:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're friends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.48,0:24:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.86,0:24:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.38,0:25:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell, did the whole\Narmor division just turn on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.00,0:25:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back here, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.62,0:25:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful, Pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.84,0:25:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still in a fight, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.72,0:25:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.92,0:25:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I'm gonna wreck ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.56,0:25:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franken-sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.42,0:25:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave for victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.68,0:25:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.38,0:26:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.50,0:26:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fun's over; I'm not\Nplaying games with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.66,0:26:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be a good boy, black leg.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:06.21,0:26:08.71,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDFGKanTeiRyu-XB-CP\bord3.5\c&HF4F3F4&\blur0.8\fscx75\fscy75\fad(475,0)\pos(1652,540)\3c&HF4F3F4&\1a&HFF&\t(433,475,\1a&H00&)}Banquet Hall\N\NThird Floor
Dialogue: 2,0:26:06.21,0:26:08.71,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDFGKanTeiRyu-XB-CP\bord0\c&H000000&\blur0.8\fscx75\fscy75\fad(475,0)\pos(1652,540)}Banquet Hall\N\NThird Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.14,0:26:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.42,0:26:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have\Nteased you all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.18,0:26:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're powerless against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.36,0:26:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took down so many men\Nwithout a hint of mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.52,0:26:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but before women like us,\Nyou won't lift a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.46,0:26:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sad little life is\Nin the palm of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.34,0:26:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could end it in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.42,0:26:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.76,0:26:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call for Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.64,0:26:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cayman lady here will help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.50,0:26:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is speak loudly to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.30,0:26:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then your words will be\Ntransmitted across the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.84,0:26:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, do that and I'll set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.86,0:27:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a rare mercy from Kaido himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.56,0:27:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what if I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.64,0:27:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'll you do to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.62,0:27:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.44,0:27:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and my girls will\Nambush her, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.42,0:27:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maim her arms and legs\Nso she can never escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.48,0:27:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.08,0:27:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mission we need her help for\Ncould take years to complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.08,0:27:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we won't kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.34,0:27:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.42,0:27:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, she won't make\Nit that easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.82,0:27:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found them!
Dialogue: 1,0:27:34.09,0:27:36.47,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDFGKanTeiRyu-XB-CP\bord3.5\c&HF4F3F4&\blur0.8\fscx65\fscy65\fad(480,0)\pos(1653,550)\3c&HF4F3F4&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)}Performance Floor
Dialogue: 2,0:27:34.09,0:27:36.47,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDFGKanTeiRyu-XB-CP\bord0\c&H000000&\blur0.8\fscx65\fscy65\fad(480,0)\pos(1653,550)}Performance Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.42,0:27:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.68,0:27:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Akazaya Samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.10,0:27:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They couldn't hide from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.34,0:27:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I thought, they got away\Nfrom the rooftop, but guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.58,0:27:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're covered in blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.18,0:27:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And are they still alive? Yes! Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.32,0:28:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're at the back of the castle tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.68,0:28:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.74,0:28:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The second floor of the treasure\Nrepository at the second Fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.38,0:28:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have escaped from Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.94,0:28:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone else handling.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.38,0:28:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm busy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.62,0:28:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to the treasure repository immediately\Nand finish off the Akazaya Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.78,0:28:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is your answer, my lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.54,0:28:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, King. Of course, I'll go. There,\Nshortly, the treasure repository is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.16,0:28:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here i'll settle the matter in no\Ntime once i finish administering some
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.26,0:28:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,discipline just get the job done
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, they lost? Wait!\NDon't go! Hey, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.46,0:28:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you know there's ten people in\Nthat room. Careful, it's so dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.52,0:28:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see very well,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.96,0:28:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's one extra\Nperson helping the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.12,0:28:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know who, but kill\Nthem too while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.38,0:29:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's in there, but who?

